XXH32 algorithm acknowledgment
-------------------------------

The checksums in src/kivrim.c and src/archive.c independently implement the
published XXH32 algorithm with seed zero. The algorithm was designed by Yann Collet.
KIVRIM does not vendor or link the upstream xxHash library.

Algorithm specification:
https://github.com/Cyan4973/xxHash/blob/v0.8.3/doc/xxhash_spec.md

